     "t": "heading",
     "level": 4,
     "text": "Leave your Review for Cape Cod Cannabis In Wellfleet!"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>At <strong>Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary</strong>, we’re committed to providing a welcoming dispensary experience with personalized service, knowledgeable guidance and a wide selection of cannabis products. Your feedback helps our team continue improving while helping others discover Cape Cod Cannabis.</p><p><strong>Share Your Experience</strong><br><strong>Choose Google or Yelp <em>below</em> to leave your review.</strong> <em>Not sure what to write?</em> Tell us what stood out about your visit such as, <em>our team, product selection, personalized guidance, store atmosphere, convenient Route 6 location or your overall experience.</em></p><p><strong>Your Feedback Matters</strong></p><p>By sharing your experience, you’re helping us grow as a trusted cannabis dispensary in Wellfleet. Whether you’re a local or visiting Cape Cod, we want to ensure every customer leaves with a smile.</p>"
    }
   ]
  },
