     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p><em>“Visitors say this dispensary offers a wide selection of products, including flower, gummies, tinctures, and paraphernalia, at reasonable prices. They also highlight the knowledgeable and friendly staff, who provide excellent guidance and helpful tips. Guests mention the store is well-organized, clean, and has a welcoming atmosphere.”</em></p>"
